Adds bar.height, a minimum bar height in logical pixels with the text
centred in it, so the bar can clear the MacBook's notch whatever the font.

diff --git a/config.def.zon b/config.def.zon
index 0c7c353..31a7224 100644
--- a/config.def.zon
+++ b/config.def.zon
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@
 
         .font = "monospace:size=10",
 
+        // minimum height in logical pixels, 0 to fit the font
+        .height = 0,
+
         .scheme = .{
             .normal = .{
                 .fg = 0x828bb8ff,
diff --git a/src/config/bar.zig b/src/config/bar.zig
